# Normalize line endings across machines. The repo is developed on Windows and its
# goldens are generated on Linux CI; without this, a checkout's CRLF would diff
# against LF-committed blobs and, worse, shift the bytes that canonical-JSON hashes
# and golden comparisons depend on. Store text as LF everywhere.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mkv binary

# SVGs are text.
*.svg text eol=lf
